<title>USA: Cass Commercial sets 2-for-1 stock split.</title>
<headline>Cass Commercial sets 2-for-1 stock split.</headline>
<dateline>ST. LOUIS 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cass Commercial Corp said on Wednesday that it set a 2-for-1 stock split in the form of a 100 percent stock dividend.</p>
<p>The company's shareshares will receive one additional share of Cass stock for each share owned on March 5, 1997. The stock dividend will be distributed on March 15, 1997.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
</text>
